sh-Cena" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="avatar__photo-link avatar__photo"><img class="image_oRbT" src="https://github.com/Josh-Cena.png" alt="Joshua Chen" /></a></div></div><div class="imageOnlyAuthorCol_uiac"><div class="avatar margin-bottom--sm"><a href="https://github.com/lex111" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="avatar__photo-link avatar__photo"><img class="image_oRbT" src="https://github.com/lex111.png" alt="Alexey Pyltsyn" /></a></div></div><div class="imageOnlyAuthorCol_uiac"><div class="avatar margin-bottom--sm"><a href="https://github.com/merceyz" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="avatar__photo-link avatar__photo"><img class="image_oRbT" src="https://github.com/merceyz.png" alt="Kristoffer K." /></a></div></div><button class="clean-btn toggleButton_WvRg" type="button" aria-label="expand" data-mm-changelog-authors={"[{\"name\":\"Yaroslav Serhieiev\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/noomorph\",\"imageURL\":\"https://github.com/noomorph.png\"},{\"name\":\"不郑\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/notzheng\",\"imageURL\":\"https://github.com/notzheng.png\"},{\"name\":\"Sébastien Lorber\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/slorber\",\"imageURL\":\"https://github.com/slorber.png\"},{\"name\":\"Ziv\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/wewoor\",\"imageURL\":\"https://github.com/wewoor.png\"},{\"name\":\"Shubhendra Singh Chauhan\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/withshubh\",\"imageURL\":\"https://github.com/withshubh.png\"},{\"name\":\"Wout Vandesompele\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/wowtvds\",\"imageURL\":\"https://github.com/wowtvds.png\"},{\"name\":\"Yangshun Tay\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/yangshun\",\"imageURL\":\"https://github.com/yangshun.png\"}]"}><svg viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor"><path d="M476.612887 1009.12034L169.240699 695.380437a51.981345 51.981345 0 0 1 0-72.319045 49.382277 49.382277 0 0 1 70.824582 0l271.959897 277.645356 271.862433-277.645356a49.382277 49.382277 0 0 1 70.824582 0 51.981345 51.981345 0 0 1 0 72.319045l-307.307212 313.739903a49.447254 49.447254 0 0 1-70.792094 0z m307.274724-608.116755L511.99269 123.455693l-271.959897 277.645357a49.382277 49.382277 0 0 1-70.824582 0 51.981345 51.981345 0 0 1 0-72.319045L476.580399 15.042102a49.382277 49.382277 0 0 1 70.727117 0l307.372188 313.739903a51.981345 51.981345 0 0 1 0 72.319045 49.414766 49.414766 0 0 1-70.824582 0z"></path></svg></button></div></header><div id="__blog-post-container" class="markdown">{"\n"}<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetHideOnScrollNavbar_qJOx" id="rocket-new-feature">🚀 New Feature<a href="#rocket-new-feature" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 🚀 New Feature" title="Direct link to 🚀 New Feature" translate="no">​</a></h2>{"\n"}<ul>{"\n"}<li class=""><code>docusaurus-theme-classic</code>, <code>docusaurus-theme-common</code>{"\n"}<ul>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/6132" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#6132</a> feat(theme-classic): new configuration syntax for a simple footer (<a href="https://github.com/christopherklint97" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@christopherklint97</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/6125" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#6125</a> feat(theme-common): stable classname for code blocks (<a href="https://github.com/Josh-Cena" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@Josh-Cena</a>)</li>{"\n"}</ul>{"\n"}</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><code>docusaurus-theme-classic</code>{"\n"}<ul>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/5848" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#5848</a> feat(theme-classic): standalone Admonition component (<a href="https://github.com/Josh-Cena" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@Josh-Cena</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/6082" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#6082</a> feat(theme-classic): allow passing additional attributes to tab headings (<a href="https://github.com/Drylozu" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@Drylozu</a>)</li>{"\n"}</ul>{"\n"}</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><code>docusaurus-plugin-content-blog</code>{"\n"}<ul>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/6126" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#6126</a> feat(content-blog): support json feed (<a href="https://github.com/notzheng" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@notzheng</a>)</li>{"\n"}</ul>{"\n"}</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><code>docusaurus</code>{"\n"}<ul>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/6107" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#6107</a> feat(core): allow plugins to customize/override Webpack devServer config (<a href="https://github.com/slorber" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@slorber</a>)</li>{"\n"}</ul>{"\n"}</li>{"\n"}</ul>{"\n"}<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetHideOnScrollNavbar_qJOx" id="bug-bug-fix">🐛 Bug Fix<a href="#bug-bug-fix" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 🐛 Bug Fix" title="Direct link to 🐛 Bug Fix" translate="no">​</a></h2>{"\n"}<ul>{"\n"}<li class=""><code>docusaurus-migrate</code>{"\n"}<ul>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/6146" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#6146</a> fix(migrate): do not modify non-MD files (<a href="https://github.com/Josh-Cena" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@Josh-Cena</a>)</li>{"\n"}</ul>{"\n"}</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><code>docusaurus-theme-classic</code>{"\n"}<ul>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/6128" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#6128</a> fix: do not use aria-hidden in heading anchor links (<a href="https://github.com/lex111" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@lex111</a>)</li>{"\n"}</ul>{"\n"}</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><code>docusaurus-plugin-content-docs</code>{"\n"}<ul>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/6124" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#6124</a> fix(content-docs): restore behavior when pagination front matter is null (<a href="https://github.com/Josh-Cena" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@Josh-Cena</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/6085" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#6085</a> fix(content-docs): getMainDocId should return doc with both versioned or unversioned id (<a href="https://github.com/slorber" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@slorber</a>)</li>{"\n"}</ul>{"\n"}</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><code>docusaurus-theme-classic</code>, <code>docusaurus-utils-validation</code>{"\n"}<ul>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/6097" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#6097</a> fix: declare missing dependencies (<a href="https://github.com/merceyz" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@merceyz</a>)</li>{"\n"}</ul>{"\n"}</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><code>docusaurus-plugin-google-analytics</code>, <code>docusaurus-plugin-google-gtag</code>, <code>docusaurus-plugin-pwa</code>, <code>docusaurus-remark-plugin-npm2yarn</code>, <code>docusaurus-theme-live-codeblock</code>, <code>docusaurus-theme-search-algolia</code>, <code>lqip-loader</code>{"\n"}<ul>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/6094" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#6094</a> fix: add missing dependencies on tslib (<a href="https://github.com/Josh-Cena" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@Josh-Cena</a>)</li>{"\n"}</ul>{"\n"}</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><code>docusaurus-theme-translations</code>{"\n"}<ul>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/6088" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#6088</a> fix(theme-translations): publish theme-translation lib, including typedef (<a href="https://github.com/slorber" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@slorber</a>)</li>{"\n"}</ul>{"\n"}</li>{"\n"}</ul>{"\n"}<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetHideOnScrollNavbar_qJOx" id="nail_care-polish">💅 Polish<a href="#nail_care-polish" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 💅 Polish" title="Direct link to 💅 Polish" translate="no">​</a></h2>{"\n"}<ul>{"\n"}<li class=""><code>docusaurus-theme-classic</code>{"\n"}<ul>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/6053" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#6053</a> feat(theme-classic): allow stylizing doc paginator arrows (<a href="https://github.com/noomorph" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@noomorph</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/6121" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#6121</a> fix(theme-classic): add outline to focused code blocks (<a href="https://github.com/christopherklint97" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@christopherklint97</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/6118" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#6118</a> refactor: remove some useless code (<a href="https://github.com/lex111" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@lex111</a>)</li>{"\n"}</ul>{"\n"}</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><code>create-docusaurus</code>, <code>docusaurus-logger</code>, <code>docusaurus-mdx-loader</code>, <code>docusaurus-migrate</code>, <code>docusaurus-plugin-client-redirects</code>, <code>docusaurus-plugin-content-blog</code>, <code>docusaurus-plugin-content-docs</code>, <code>docusaurus-theme-classic</code>, <code>docusaurus-theme-search-algolia</code>, <code>docusaurus-theme-translations</code>, <code>docusaurus-utils-validation</code>, <code>docusaurus-utils</code>, <code>docusaurus</code>{"\n"}<ul>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/5994" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#5994</a> refactor: unify log format with new logger utility (<a href="https://github.com/Josh-Cena" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@Josh-Cena</a>)</li>{"\n"}</ul>{"\n"}</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><code>create-docusaurus</code>{"\n"}<ul>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/6119" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#6119</a> fix(create-docusaurus): make initial editUrl functional (<a href="https://github.com/Josh-Cena" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@Josh-Cena</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/6095" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#6095</a> fix(create-docusaurus): give a clearer message when installation failed (<a href="https://github.com/Josh-Cena" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@Josh-Cena</a>)</li>{"\n"}</ul>{"\n"}</li>{"\n"}</ul>{"\n"}<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetHideOnScrollNavbar_qJOx" id="memo-documentation">📝 Documentation<a href="#memo-documentation" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 📝 Documentation" title="Direct link to 📝 Documentation" translate="no">​</a></h2>{"\n"}<ul>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/6142" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#6142</a> docs: normalize usage of placeholders (<a href="https://github.com/Josh-Cena" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@Josh-Cena</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/5918" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#5918</a> docs: refactor &amp; refine lifecycle API docs (<a href="https://github.com/Josh-Cena" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@Josh-Cena</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/6138" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#6138</a> docs: add Smart Docs to showcase (<a href="https://github.com/wowtvds" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@wowtvds</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/6137" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#6137</a> docs: add ToolJet to showcase (<a href="https://github.com/withshubh" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@withshubh</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/6141" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#6141</a> docs: add WoodpeckerCI to showcase (<a href="https://github.com/6543" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@6543</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/6135" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#6135</a> docs: mention admonition quirks with Prettier (<a href="https://github.com/yangshun" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@yangshun</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/6131" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#6131</a> docs: elaborate on "docs-only" and "blog-only" (<a href="https://github.com/himanshu007-creator" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@himanshu007-creator</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/6134" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#6134</a> docs: update link to init template README.md (<a href="https://github.com/cmpadden" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@cmpadden</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/6130" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#6130</a> docs: refactor docs sidebar doc (<a href="https://github.com/Josh-Cena" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@Josh-Cena</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/6129" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#6129</a> docs: refactor styling/theming docs (<a href="https://github.com/Josh-Cena" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@Josh-Cena</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/6112" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#6112</a> docs: mention that SEO through front matter is better than head tag (<a href="https://github.com/Josh-Cena" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@Josh-Cena</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/6120" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#6120</a> refactor(website): make deploy preview open next version docs by default (<a href="https://github.com/Josh-Cena" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@Josh-Cena</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/6111" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#6111</a> docs: add Molecule website to showcase (<a href="https://github.com/wewoor" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@wewoor</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/6089" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#6089</a> docs: add Enarx website to showcase (<a href="https://github.com/HarshCasper" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@HarshCasper</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/6090" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#6090</a> docs: add sapphire to showcase (<a href="https://github.com/favna" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@favna</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/6091" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#6091</a> docs(showcase): "much more pages" =&gt; "many more pages" (<a href="https://github.com/favna" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@favna</a>)</li>{"\n"}</ul>{"\n"}<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetHideOnScrollNavbar_qJOx" id="house-internal">🏠 Internal<a href="#house-internal" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 🏠 Internal" title="Direct link to 🏠 Internal" translate="no">​</a></h2>{"\n"}<ul>{"\n"}<li class=""><code>docusaurus-theme-classic</code>{"\n"}<ul>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/6144" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#6144</a> fix(theme-classic): fix translation when footer has no links (<a href="https://github.com/Josh-Cena" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@Josh-Cena</a>)</li>{"\n"}</ul>{"\n"}</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><code>docusaurus-plugin-content-docs</code>{"\n"}<ul>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/6143" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#6143</a> test: fix async tests resolved in random order (<a href="https://github.com/Josh-Cena" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@Josh-Cena</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/6123" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#6123</a> test: use snapshots for sidebar tests (<a href="https://github.com/Josh-Cena" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@Josh-Cena</a>)</li>{"\n"}</ul>{"\n"}</li>{"\n"}<li class="">{"Other\n"}<ul>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/6122" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#6122</a> fix(website): fix yarn build:website:fast (<a href="https://github.com/slorber" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@slorber</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/6080" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#6080</a> chore: add npm and pnpm to E2E tests (<a href="https://github.com/Josh-Cena" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@Josh-Cena</a>)</li>{"\n"}</ul>{"\n"}</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><code>create-docusaurus</code>, <code>docusaurus-cssnano-preset</code>, <code>docusaurus-mdx-loader</code>, <code>docusaurus-migrate</code>, <code>docusaurus-plugin-client-redirects</code>, <code>docusaurus-plugin-content-blog</code>, <code>docusaurus-plugin-content-docs</code>, <code>docusaurus-plugin-content-pages</code>, <code>docusaurus-plugin-debug</code>, <code>docusaurus-plugin-google-analytics</code>, <code>docusaurus-plugin-google-gtag</code>, <code>docusaurus-plugin-ideal-image</code>, <code>docusaurus-plugin-pwa</code>, <code>docusaurus-plugin-sitemap</code>, <code>docusaurus-preset-classic</code>, <code>docusaurus-remark-plugin-npm2yarn</code>, <code>docusaurus-theme-classic</code>, <code>docusaurus-theme-common</code>, <code>docusaurus-theme-live-codeblock</code>, <code>docusaurus-theme-search-algolia</code>, <code>docusaurus-theme-translations</code>, <code>docusaurus-types</code>, <code>docusaurus-utils-common</code>, <code>docusaurus-utils-validation</code>, <code>docusaurus-utils</code>, <code>docusaurus</code>, <code>lqip-loader</code>{"\n"}<ul>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/6092" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#6092</a> misc: ignore some files during npm publish (<a href="https://github.com/Josh-Cena" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@Josh-Cena</a>)</li>{"\n"}</ul>{"\n"}</li>{"\n"}</ul>{"\n"}<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetHideOnScrollNavbar_qJOx" id="committers-17">Committers: 17<a href="#committers-17" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Committers: 17" title="Direct link to Committers: 17" translate="no">​</a></h2>{"\n"}<ul>{"\n"}<li class="">6543 (<a href="https://github.com/6543" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@6543</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class="">Alexey Pyltsyn (<a href="https://github.com/lex111" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@lex111</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class="">Christopher Klint (<a href="https://github.com/christopherklint97" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@christopherklint97</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class="">Harsh Mishra (<a href="https://github.com/HarshCasper" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@HarshCasper</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class="">Himanshu (<a href="https://github.com/himanshu007-creator" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@himanshu007-creator</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class="">Jeroen Claassens (<a href="https://github.com/favna" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@favna</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class="">Joshua Chen (<a href="https://github.com/Josh-Cena" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@Josh-Cena</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class="">Kristoffer K. (<a href="https://github.com/merceyz" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@merceyz</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class="">Shubhendra Singh Chauhan (<a href="https://github.com/withshubh" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@withshubh</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class="">Sébastien Lorber (<a href="https://github.com/slorber" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@slorber</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class="">Wout Vandesompele (<a href="https://github.com/wowtvds" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@wowtvds</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class="">Yangshun Tay (<a href="https://github.com/yangshun" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@yangshun</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class="">Yaroslav Serhieiev (<a href="https://github.com/noomorph" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@noomorph</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class="">Ziv (<a href="https://github.com/wewoor" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@wewoor</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/Drylozu" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@Drylozu</a></li>{"\n"}<li class="">colton (<a href="https://github.com/cmpadden" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@cmpadden</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class="">不郑 (<a href="https://github.com/notzheng" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@notzheng</a>)</l